meals a year

00:12:28.847 --> 00:12:30.916
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:30.916 --> 00:12:32.384
cancer, and other
serious illnesses,

00:12:32.384 --> 00:12:34.186
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:12:34.186 --> 00:12:36.288
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:12:36.288 --> 00:12:38.758
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

